* networking
* cloud infrastructure
* security
* reliability

---

## Stage 6 — Distributed Components

Only when there is a concrete reason:

```text
             API
              │
      ┌───────┴───────┐
      ↓               ↓
   Orders          Products
      │
      ↓
   Message Queue
      │
      ↓
 Notification Service
```

Focus:

* asynchronous communication
* messaging
* eventual consistency
* failure handling

